    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aesop Rock's Black Hole Superette Experience</i> is a surreal, first-person exploration game set in a fictional convenience store brimming with absurdity, hidden meanings, and sonic treasures. As you wander the aisles in search of audio fragments, you\u2019ll unlock cryptic words of wisdom from Aesop Rock himself. Sample your way through the entire <i>Black Hole Superette</i> album, uncover exclusive content, and dig into a universe packed with deep cuts, easter eggs, and offbeat lore only the most dedicated heads will decode. Welcome to the weirdest corner store you\u2019ve never escaped!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aesop Rock's Black Hole Superette Experience</i> is a surreal, first-person exploration game set in a fictional convenience store brimming with absurdity, hidden meanings, and sonic treasures. As you wander the aisles in search of audio fragments, you\u2019ll unlock cryptic words of wisdom from Aesop Rock himself. Sample your way through the entire <i>Black Hole Superette</i> album, uncover exclusive content, and dig into a universe packed with deep cuts, easter eggs, and offbeat lore only the most dedicated heads will decode. Welcome to the weirdest corner store you\u2019ve never escaped!</p>",
